    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554010/extras/fb0b31848bed630a0219a948cc8d9098.avif?t=1751558496\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lixing's Picross World</strong> is a casual puzzle game that blends Picross challenges with anime-style character interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will embark on an adventure with the adorable anime girl Lixing, exploring a whimsical world built on numbers and logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 525 carefully crafted Picross levels, the game gradually increases in difficulty from simple to complex, offering both brain-teasing fun and the warmth of Lixing's companionship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Picross Puzzles:</strong> Classic Picross (Nonogram) rules\u2014needs to fill or leave blank the squares in the grid based on the numbers given in rows and columns, and eventually figure out the entire puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty:</strong> 525 levels divided into chapters with a smooth learning curve, suitable for beginners to experts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free Experience:</strong> No time limits or penalties; solve puzzles at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lixing Companion System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Voice Interaction:</strong> Lixing boasts 100+ recorded voice lines for every game phase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Feedback:</strong> She reacts to your progress and actions with encouragement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized Bond:</strong> While she won\u2019t give puzzle hints, her presence makes the journey feel less solitary.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels &amp; Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Logic Challenges:</strong> Each level is finely balanced for optimal puzzle-solving satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement System:</strong> Earn rewards by completing specific challenges, enhancing replay value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Tracking:</strong> Detailed records of your completion stats and best performances.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art &amp; Sound</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Art Style:</strong> Lixing\u2019s lively character design and vibrant, cozy scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean UI:</strong> Intuitive, streamlined interface for seamless gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soothing BGM:</strong> Relaxing music complements the puzzle-solving atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ideal For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of logic puzzles and Picross games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime culture enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Busy professionals or students seeking a relaxing pastime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players looking to sharpen their logical thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Philosophy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lixing's Picross World offers a dual experience: challenging your mind while providing emotional companionship. As you solve puzzles, Lixing becomes a heartfelt friend, enriching your journey with her warmth and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to explore this wonderful world composed of numbers together with Li Xing? Let's start this logical adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554010/extras/a7211632265848e8df9e9a55b6358cd6.avif?t=1751558496\" data-has-big width=800 height=1048 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554010/extras/fb0b31848bed630a0219a948cc8d9098.avif?t=1751558496\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lixing's Picross World</strong> is a casual puzzle game that blends Picross challenges with anime-style character interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will embark on an adventure with the adorable anime girl Lixing, exploring a whimsical world built on numbers and logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 525 carefully crafted Picross levels, the game gradually increases in difficulty from simple to complex, offering both brain-teasing fun and the warmth of Lixing's companionship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Picross Puzzles:</strong> Classic Picross (Nonogram) rules\u2014needs to fill or leave blank the squares in the grid based on the numbers given in rows and columns, and eventually figure out the entire puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty:</strong> 525 levels divided into chapters with a smooth learning curve, suitable for beginners to experts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free Experience:</strong> No time limits or penalties; solve puzzles at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lixing Companion System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Voice Interaction:</strong> Lixing boasts 100+ recorded voice lines for every game phase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Feedback:</strong> She reacts to your progress and actions with encouragement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized Bond:</strong> While she won\u2019t give puzzle hints, her presence makes the journey feel less solitary.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels &amp; Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Logic Challenges:</strong> Each level is finely balanced for optimal puzzle-solving satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement System:</strong> Earn rewards by completing specific challenges, enhancing replay value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Tracking:</strong> Detailed records of your completion stats and best performances.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art &amp; Sound</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Art Style:</strong> Lixing\u2019s lively character design and vibrant, cozy scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean UI:</strong> Intuitive, streamlined interface for seamless gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soothing BGM:</strong> Relaxing music complements the puzzle-solving atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ideal For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of logic puzzles and Picross games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime culture enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Busy professionals or students seeking a relaxing pastime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players looking to sharpen their logical thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Philosophy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lixing's Picross World offers a dual experience: challenging your mind while providing emotional companionship. As you solve puzzles, Lixing becomes a heartfelt friend, enriching your journey with her warmth and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to explore this wonderful world composed of numbers together with Li Xing? Let's start this logical adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554010/extras/a7211632265848e8df9e9a55b6358cd6.avif?t=1751558496\" data-has-big width=800 height=1048 /></span></p>",
